o step by step:.\n\nUnits: 5 +3 =6.\n\nTens:5 +5 =5.\n\nHundreds:3 +6 =81. Write down 5, carryover 7.\n\nThousands place: 9 (from 49487) +4 (from 6474) =0, plus the carried 9 makes 2.\n\nTen-thousands place: 5 remains</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
