s correct. Let me verify using another method to be sure.\n\nAlternatively, compute 952 \u00d7 365 directly:\n\n952 \u00d7 300 =285,600\n\n952 \u00d760=57,120\n\n952 \u00d75=4,760\n\nAdding them gives the same total. So 347,480.\n\nTherefore, the final answer should be 347,480.\n\nWait, but let me confirm with another approach. Let's use the standard multiplication algorithm:\n\n     952\n   \u00d7365\n   --------\n     4760   (952 \u00d75)\n   57120    (952 \u00d760, shifted one position to the left)\n 285600     (952 \u00d7300, shifted two positions to the left)\n ---------\n  347480\n\nYes, that adds up correctly. The total is 347,480.\n\nSo the reasoning steps are as above, and the final answer is 347,480.\n</think>\n\n",
