cks out.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is 207,405.\n\nBut in my initial thinking process, I messed up the numbers because I was confused between different problems. So I need to make sure to follow the correct steps here. The user's actual question is 419 multiplied by 495, so the answer is indeed 207,405.\n</think>\n\n",
