own into steps based on the digits of 523 (500, 20, and 3):\n\n1. Multiply 193 by the ones place digit (3):\n   \\[\n   193 \\times 3 = 579\n   \\]\n\n2. Multiply 193 by the tens place digit (20):\n   \\[\n   193 \\times 20 = 3860\n   \\]\n\n3. Multiply 193 by the hundreds place digit (500):\n   \\[\n   193 \\times 500 = 96500\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the partial results:\n\\[\n579 + 3860 + 96500 = 100939\n\\]\n\nThus, the final computed product is \\(\\boxed{100939}\\).", '']
