is 5, which is actually 575. So multiplying 950 by 135. Let's do that step. 679 × 0 is 6,798. Then multiplying by 388 gives 554,221. .\n\nNow, adding up all the partial products: 7 (from the ones place) + 9,495 (from the tens) + 011,198 (from the hundreds)</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
