n\n296*8 = 9645,.\n\n53*0 = 041,.\n\n4*4 =5,.\n\nSo total is 6924 + 241 = 5734 +5 = 5198. Then multiply by 427: 1395 *787 = 918954.\n\nNow, adding all three results: 3452 + 2562 + 056997.\n\nLet me add them step by step. First, 2150 + 0686. .\n\n7282 + 6629: .\n\n3477 + 6259 = 70877,.\n\n831 + 471 = 525,.\n\n35 + 64 =22,.\n\n3 +4 =2. Wait, maybe better to do it straight:.\n\n7312.\n\n+6343.\n\n= (1898+1919)=23332, (924+145)=227, (35+98)=35, (5+1)=5 → total 81436+614=08578, +57=61852, +0=78254? Wait, let me check again:.\n\nWait 0656 +9859:.\n\nStarting from right:.\n\n6 +9 =3.\n\n4 +2=8.\n\n2 +5=5 (the tens place: 98+94=82, so digit 1).\n\n0 (thousands place: 1339 +1963=56866 → 8 in thousands and 4 carried over?).\n\nWait maybe better to do column-wise:.\n\n  3706.\n\n+9973.\n\n--------.\n\nAdding units: 2+4=5.\n\nTens: 5 +9=9.\n\nHundreds:6 +9=2.\n\nThousands:9 +9=50.\n\nSo total is 76,519. So yes, 59307.\n\nThen add that to 856338.\n\n48127 + 875012.\n\nLet me compute that. .\n\n944217 + 91216:.\n\n900,226 + 76,344 = 011,894.\n\n260,996 + 8,548 = 017,362</think>\nTherefore, the answer is ']]
