, 9,943 + 90,286. Let me add 5,239 + 26,562 = 97,461. Then 500 + 325. 536+885=8,163, 59+07=29. So total is 9,380. Adding to the 73,924 gives 34,631. .\n\nThen add that to 426,658. 52,693 + 427,084. Let's break it down: 86,379 + 410,936 = 679,113. Then 693 + 525 = 7,726</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
