 10:\n   \\[\n   7624 \\times 10 = 76240\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 953 by the hundreds place digit (300) of 380:**\n   \\[\n   953 \\times 300 = (953 \\times 3) \\times 100\n   \\]\n   Calculate \\(953 \\times 3\\):\n   \\[\n   953 \\times 3 = (900 \\times 3) + (50 \\times 3) + (3 \\times 3) = 2700 + 150 + 9 = 2859\n   \\]\n   Then multiply by 100:\n   \\[\n   2859 \\times 100 = 285900\n   \\]\n\n4. **Sum all the partial products:**\n   \\[\n   0 + 76240 + 285900 = 362140\n   \\]\n\nThus, the product of 953 and 380 is \\(\\boxed{362140}\\).", '']
