n 11,004 + 78,600 = 89,604. So the final answer is 89,604. I think that's correct. Let me check once more with another method, like the distributive property:\n\n786 \u00d7 114 = 786 \u00d7 (100 + 10 +4) = 786\u00d7100 + 786\u00d710 + 786\u00d74 = same as before. So yes, 89,604 is correct.\n\nI must have confused the numbers in my first attempt, probably mixing up digits from another problem. But now I've corrected it. So the answer should be 89,604.\n\n</think>\n\n",
