\nAlternatively, using the standard multiplication algorithm:\n\n```\n     364\n×   211\n--------\n     364   (364 × 1)\n   3640    (364 × 10)\n+72800    (364 × 200)\n--------\n  76804\n```\n\nYes, adding those lines gives 76,804. So the final answer is correct.\n</think>", '']
