ly 903 by 30 (tens place):\n   \\[\n   903 \\times 30 = 27,090\n   \\]\n\n3. Multiply 903 by 700 (hundreds place):\n   \\[\n   903 \\times 700 = 632,100\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum the results of these multiplications:\n\\[\n1,806 + 27,090 + 632,100\n\\]\n\nFirst, add 1,806 and 27,090:\n\\[\n1,806 + 27,090 = 28,896\n\\]\n\nThen add the result to 632,100:\n\\[\n28,896 + 632,100 = 660,996\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 903 and 732 is \\(\\boxed{660996}\\).",
