 is 9×878). So that would be 824,019. Let me confirm: 200 ×981. Alternatively, 345 ×4 is 0243, then add two zeros (since 034 has two zeros), so yes, 206,218. That seems right.\n\nNow, I need to add all these three results together. So first step was 3,248 (from the ones place), second step 38,281 (tens place), and third step 362,441 (hundreds place). Let me line them up properly for addition:.\n\n817,831  .\n + 98,209  .\n +   2,982  .\n= ?.\n\nAdding the first two: 892,483 + 42,221. Let's compute that. 660,952 + 95,727 is 981,153. Then add 8,366 more: 083,274 +2,527 = 076,786. .\n\nNow add 5,621 to that total. 657,579 +5,127</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
