 squares formula**:\n   \\[\n   (652 - 1)(652 + 1) = 652^2 - 1^2\n   \\]\n3. **Calculate \\( 652^2 \\)**:\n   \\[\n   652^2 = (650 + 2)^2 = 650^2 + 2 \\cdot 650 \\cdot 2 + 2^2\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   650^2 = 422500, \\quad 2 \\cdot 650 \\cdot 2 = 2600, \\quad 2^2 = 4\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   652^2 = 422500 + 2600 + 4 = 425104\n   \\]\n4. **Subtract 1**:\n   \\[\n   652^2 - 1 = 425104 - 1 = 425103\n   \\]\n\nThus, the product of 651 and 653 is \\(\\boxed{425103}\\).", '']
