n3. Multiply 660 by the hundreds place digit (400): 660 \u00d7 400 = 264,000.\n\nNow, sum all the step results: 1,320 + 33,000 + 264,000 = 298,320.\n\nAnswer:\nSo, the final computed product is 298,320.",
