ace). Let me add them step by step. .\n\nFirst, 5351 + 45,765. Let's see, 8524 + 37,914 is 25,438, then add 58 more to get 26,192. Then add that to 099,581. .\n\nAdding 55,425 and 096,024. Hmm, 865,562 + 36,722 is 601,378</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
