4, so 7,356 × 361 = 730,026. So the third partial product is 071,641.\n\nNow I need to add all three partial products together:.\n\nFirst:\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003850.\nSecond:\u2003\u200333,205.\nThird:\u2003066,328.\n-------------------.\nLet's line them up properly:.\n\n\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003502.\n\u2003\u2003\u200328,203.\n+ 773,991.\n-----------.\nAdding the first two: 354 + 19,597 = 27,278. Then add that to 150,672. .\n\n24,693 + 338,097</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
