\n   674\nx 310\n-------\n   000  (674 x 0)\n 6740   (674 x 10)\n202200  (674 x 300)\n-------\n208940\n\nYes, that adds up. So the answer is 208,940. I think that's correct. I need to make sure I didn't make any arithmetic errors. Let me check 674*300 again. 674 * 3 is 2,022, so times 100 is 202,200. Then 674*10 is 6,740. Adding them: 202,200 + 6,740. 202,200 + 6,000 is 208,200, then plus 740 is 208,940. Yep, that's right. Okay, confident now.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 674 and 310 is \\boxed{208940}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 674 and 310, we break down the multiplication step by step using the place values of 310:\n\n1. **Multiply 674 by the ones place digit (0):**\n   \\[\n   674 \\times 0 = 0\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 674 by the tens place digit (10):**\n   \\[\n   674 \\times 10 = 6740\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 674 by the hundreds place digit (300):**\n   \\[\n   674 \\times 300 = 202200\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the partial products:\n\\[\n0 + 6740 + 202200 = 208940\n\\]\n\nThus, the final product of 674 and 310 is \\(\\boxed{208940}\\).", '']
