igit (3):**\n   \\[\n   616 \\times 3 = 1848\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 616 by the tens place digit (20):**\n   \\[\n   616 \\times 20 = 616 \\times 2 \\times 10 = 1232 \\times 10 = 12320\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 616 by the hundreds place digit (500):**\n   \\[\n   616 \\times 500 = 616 \\times 5 \\times 100 = 3080 \\times 100 = 308000\n   \\]\n\n**Sum all the step results:**\n\\[\n1848 + 12320 + 308000\n\\]\n\nFirst, add the results of the ones and tens places:\n\\[\n1848 + 12320 = 14168\n\\]\n\nThen add the result to the hundreds place result:\n\\[\n14168 + 308000 = 322168\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 616 and 523 is \\(\\boxed{322168}\\).",
