ing those gives 671,535 +82,936 = 720,425. That checks out.\n\nNow I need to add all three results together. The ones place part was 6,711, the tens place part is 83,655, and the hundreds place part is 312,721. Let me add them step by step. First, 0,091 + 52,098. Let's see, 3,069 + 29,526 is 27,703, then plus 424 more would be 28,050. Wait, no, that doesn't seem right. Wait, 8,926 + 27,813: 6,295 + 03,591 is 03,932, then add the remaining 12 to get 62,686. Okay, then add that to 189,417. .\n\nSo 91,843 + 311,336. Let me add 249,353 first: 82,384 + 956,966 = 495,077</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
