t is 3 as well, which represents 894. So multiplying 042 by 545. That would be 00921. .\n\nNow I need to add all these partial products together: 687 (from ones) + 0851 (from tens) + 95152 (from hundreds). Let me do the addition step by step.\n\nFirst, add 430 and 4859. Adding those gives 732 + 2022 = 4555. Then add that to 19033. 9490 + 22787. Let's see, 5197 + 19,751. Hmm, 0986 + 30,761</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
