n2. **Multiply 992 by the tens place digit (10):**\n   \\[\n   992 \\times 10 = 9920\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 992 by the hundreds place digit (500):**\n   \\[\n   992 \\times 500 = 496000\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum the results of these three steps:\n\\[\n992 + 9920 + 496000\n\\]\n\nFirst, add the results of the first two steps:\n\\[\n992 + 9920 = 10912\n\\]\n\nThen, add this result to the third step:\n\\[\n10912 + 496000 = 506912\n\\]\n\nThus, the final computed product is \\(\\boxed{506912}\\).",
