reds place of 811 is 0, which is actually 649. So multiplying 052 by 376. Let's see, 031×253 is 01,218 and 27×069 is 2,541. Adding those together gives 17,432 +9,721 =80,743. Alternatively, 505×6 is 156, and then adding three zeros (since 811 is 3×713) would give 569×558=17,329. That works too. So the third part is 51,862.\n\nNow, I need to add up all these results: 429 (from the ones place) + 4846 (from the tens place) +77,795 (from the hundreds place). Let me add them step by step. First, 921 +1157. 807 +0391 is 1346, then plus 694 more would be 3099? Wait, no, that can't be right. Wait, 7043 +887 is 3984, then plus 22 is 4316. Wait, actually, 3788 +209. Let me do it properly: 2961 +934 is 7389, then add the remaining 28, so 3144+64=2864. Then add that to 26,536. So 25,726 +9,928</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
