rt was 2, the tens place part was 42,045, and the hundreds place part was 862,348. Adding those: 28,603 + 993,089. Let me do that addition. .\n\nFirst, adding 03,007 and 406,489. Let's see, 01,932 + 420,016. Maybe align them properly:.\n\n763,174.\n+  10,349.\n----------.\n?.\n\nStarting from the right: 1 +9 is 4. 8 +5 is 9. 8 +2 is 31, carry over 7. 0 +4 is 58 plus the 2 is 84, carry over 5. 4 (from 981,111) plus nothing plus the 2 is 7. Wait, maybe I should write it out:.\n\n158,377.\n+  75,654</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
