0):**  \n   \\( 921 \\times 30 = 27,\\!630 \\)\n\n3. **Hundreds place (300):**  \n   \\( 921 \\times 300 = 276,\\!300 \\)\n\n**Summing all parts:**  \n\\( 3,\\!684 + 27,\\!630 = 31,\\!314 \\)  \n\\( 31,\\!314 + 276,\\!300 = 307,\\!614 \\)\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe product of 921 and 334 is \\(\\boxed{307614}\\).",
