ion: \\(669 \\times 5 = 3345\\), then multiply by 10: \\(3345 \\times 10 = 33450\\)\n\n3. **Multiply 669 by the hundreds place digit (700):**\n   \\[\n   669 \\times 700 = 468300\n   \\]\n   - Calculation: \\(669 \\times 7 = 4683\\), then multiply by 100: \\(4683 \\times 100 = 468300\\)\n\n4. **Sum all the results:**\n   \\[\n   4683 + 33450 + 468300 = 506433\n   \\]\n   - First sum: \\(4683 + 33450 = 38133\\)\n   - Second sum: \\(38133 + 468300 = 506433\\)\n\n### Final Answer\nThe product of 669 and 757 is \\boxed{506433}.",
